# Xcode Build & Test

**DEVELOPER_DIR** must point to `~/Downloads/Xcode.app/Contents/Developer` because `xcode-select` is set to Command Line Tools, not full Xcode. **Always** prefix every `xcodebuild` call with this environment variable.

## Build

```bash
cd ~/Documents/repo/FitnessApp && DEVELOPER_DIR=/Users/jose.nunez/Downloads/Xcode.app/Contents/Developer xcodebuild build -scheme FitnessApp -destination 'platform=iOS Simulator,name=iPhone 17 Pro Max' 2>&1 | tail -30
```

## Unit Tests

```bash
cd ~/Documents/repo/FitnessApp && DEVELOPER_DIR=/Users/jose.nunez/Downloads/Xcode.app/Contents/Developer xcodebuild test -scheme FitnessApp -destination 'platform=iOS Simulator,name=iPhone 17 Pro Max' -only-testing:FitnessAppTests 2>&1 | tail -30
```

## UI Tests

```bash
cd ~/Documents/repo/FitnessApp && DEVELOPER_DIR=/Users/jose.nunez/Downloads/Xcode.app/Contents/Developer xcodebuild test -scheme FitnessApp -destination 'platform=iOS Simulator,name=iPhone 17 Pro Max' -only-testing:FitnessAppUITests 2>&1 | tail -30
```

## Package Tests (SPM)

Package tests run via `xcodebuild` from each package directory with `-skipMacroValidation` (required for swift-testing macros). Do **not** use `swift test` — SwiftData macros require the Xcode build system.

### Single package

```bash
cd ~/Documents/repo/FitnessApp/Packages/FitnessTraining && DEVELOPER_DIR=/Users/jose.nunez/Downloads/Xcode.app/Contents/Developer xcodebuild test -scheme FitnessTraining -destination 'platform=iOS Simulator,name=iPhone 17 Pro Max' -skipMacroValidation 2>&1 | tail -30
```

### All packages

```bash
for pkg in FitnessExercise FitnessTraining FitnessAnalytics FitnessStorage; do
  echo "=== Testing $pkg ===" && \
  cd ~/Documents/repo/FitnessApp/Packages/$pkg && \
  DEVELOPER_DIR=/Users/jose.nunez/Downloads/Xcode.app/Contents/Developer xcodebuild test -scheme $pkg -destination 'platform=iOS Simulator,name=iPhone 17 Pro Max' -skipMacroValidation 2>&1 | tail -10
done
```

### Available package test targets

| Package | Scheme | Test count |
|---|---|---|
| `FitnessTraining` | `FitnessTraining` | 45 |
| `FitnessAnalytics` | `FitnessAnalytics` | 18 |
| `FitnessExercise` | `FitnessExercise` | ~20 |
| `FitnessStorage` | `FitnessStorage` | 28 |

## Notes

- **Scheme**: Use `FitnessApp` for app-level tests (not `FitnessApp UITests`).
- **Simulator**: `iPhone 17 Pro Max`.
- To run a **single test**, append the test class and method: `-only-testing:FitnessAppUITests/TrainingUITests/testFullTrainingFlow`
- To run **all UI tests**, use: `-only-testing:FitnessAppUITests`
- Set `block_until_ms` to `300000` (5 min) since build + test takes ~90–120 seconds.
- Do **not** use `swift test` or `swift build` — SwiftData macros require the Xcode build system.
- Always add `-skipMacroValidation` when running package tests via CLI.
